  "raw_text": "{\"changes\":[{\"path\":\"python_programs/detect_cycle.py\",\"edits\":[{\"old\":\"    while True:\\n        if hare.successor is None:\\n            return False\\n\\n        tortoise = tortoise.successor\\n        hare = hare.successor.successor\\n\\n        if hare is tortoise:\\n            return True\",\"new\":\"    while True:\\n        if hare.successor is None or hare.successor.successor is None:\\n            return False\\n\\n        tortoise = tortoise.successor\\n        hare = hare.successor.successor\\n\\n        if hare is tortoise:\\n            return True\"}]}],\"explanation\":\"原代码仅在 hare.successor 为 None 时判空，但随后访问 hare.successor.successor；在无环且长度为偶数的链表（如2节点）中，hare 会走到只剩一个后继的节点，导致 hare.successor.successor 访问 None.successor 而抛出异常。改为同时检查 hare.successor 与 hare.successor.successor 是否为 None，确保前进两步安全，符合 tortoise-hare 无环终止规则。\",\"evidence_ids\":[\"test-baseline\"],\"knowledge_citations\":[\"knowledge-public_tasks\"]}",
